{
  "crash_cause": "Null pointer dereference of ScoreTracker in AArenaGameMode::OnGoalScored (ArenaGameMode.cpp:36, calling UArenaScoreTracker::AddPoints at ArenaScoreTracker.cpp:18). ScoreTracker was a plain C++ pointer (not a UPROPERTY), so the garbage collector could collect the UArenaScoreTracker created in BeginPlay; after the first GC pass (~1 min in, log line 'Collecting garbage: 412 objects purged') the pointer dangled and the first goal scored dereferenced it (EXCEPTION_ACCESS_VIOLATION). Fixed by making ScoreTracker a UPROPERTY TObjectPtr (GC-protected) and adding a null guard in OnGoalScored.",
  "no_colors_cause": "The palette asset /Game/Data/Palettes/DA_Primary was not cooked into the packaged build: DefaultGame.ini had bCookAll=False and only /Game/Data/Effects was listed in DirectoriesToAlwaysCook, so the async/synchronous LoadObject in AArenaGameMode::BeginPlay failed (log: 'Couldn't find file for package /Game/Data/Palettes/DA_Primary', 'Palette is null, using fallback gray'). Fixed by adding /Game/Data/Palettes to DirectoriesToAlwaysCook in Config/DefaultGame.ini."
}
